    |              V           | #   |  |
    |           +-----+        |     |  |
6 --------*-----|  =  |------->|   #-+-----> 720
    |     |     +-----+        |  /  |  |
    |     |                    | #   |  |
    |     |                    +-----+  |
    |     |                       ^     |
    |     |                       |     |
    |     |                    +--+--+  |
    |     *------------------->|  *  |  |
    |     |                    +-----+  |
    |     V                       ^     |
    |  +-----+    +-----------+   |     |
    |  |  -  +--->| factorial +---+     |
    |  +-----+    +-----------+         |
    |     ^                             |
    |     |1                            |
    +-----------------------------------+
@end example
@end ifinfo
